WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
In Customize, open Connectors, then Add and Add custom connector.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Name it PC Remote Commander, paste the PCRC server URL, then choose Continue.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose Sign in now and Claude’s published identity when offered.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Finish adding the connector. If it shows as disconnected, click Connect.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Review the PCRC account and requested permissions. Select Allow access if they match.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Back in Claude, enable PCRC under + and Connectors. Ask for a read-only workspace check.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.500
For local use on the same PC, configure Claude Desktop to launch the installed PCRC stdio command.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Check the runtime and workspace paths, then restart Claude Desktop and try listing your workspace.
